  "observations": "[18.12. RT 24.2°C and RH 31%]\nAdd 12.5 mL of neutral alumina to a 25 mL frit funnel.\nAttach the funnel to a vacuum filter adapter and a 250 mL RBF.\nWet the alumina with THF\nLoad the reaction mixture\nElute with THF (75 mL) and weak suction. (eluate: dark red to pale pink)  (The alumina pad became dark green at the top, pale green in the middle, and a little brown part at the bottom)\nAdd EtOH 25 mL to the eluate\nConcentrate with rotovap to 25 mL. (dark brown precipitation)\nCollect the solids by filtration with a filter paper (15A, ø 90 mm, tare: 0.51740 g), a glass funnel, a vacuum filter adapter, and a 100 mL RBF under suction. (filtrate: dark green solution)\nRinse with EtOH x3 and petroleum ether x2.\nDry filtrate with rotovap\n[15.1.]\n1H NMR-filtrate (DMSO)\nDry the residue under vacuum (diaphragm pump) for 1 h. [dark brown solid]\n 0.26716 g  wt. on Filter paper.\nTransfer to vial with label and tape (tare: 8.10142 g) --> 0.26232 g\nThe residue on filter paper → 1H NMR paper (CDCl3) [green solution]\n1H NMR P_unfiltered (CDCl3) [dark red-brown suspension] → Syringe filter → 1H NMR_P [dark red-brown solution]\n[15.1.]\n1H NMR P (DMSO)",
